    "id": "pose_59_sitting_ladylike_hand_at_neck",
    "name": "Ladylike floor sitting, hand at the neck",
    "description": "Sitting wariza-style with the torso upright, the right hand resting on the right thigh and the left hand touching the side of the neck with the elbow bent out. The head tilts slightly left. Left/right are the character's own.",
    "targetModels": [
      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Single front-view line drawing used as reference; the neck hand reads as fingers at the collar; the buttocks hover in side view and the knees sit less forward than the drawing because the rig calf limit (140 deg) cannot make the true wariza fold (~160 deg).",
      "Knees share floor contact with toes grazing; root height is the female/male mean within the 10 mm floor tolerance.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male reuses the same rotations with the hips-height-relative root offset."
    ],
    "generator": "scripts/pose_author/lib.py + /tmp/author_floor.py (poses-only scope; authoring script not committed)"
  },
